# Repo vend agent rules

Before inventing naming or HITL behavior, **read and follow** [`rules/naming.md`](../../rules/naming.md) and [`repo-vend.yaml`](../../repo-vend.yaml).

Customize templates / approval keywords / board URL via `repo-vend.yaml` — see [`docs/customizing.md`](../../docs/customizing.md).

Flow: **propose** on New Request create → Keyword Approval → **vend** from `requests/<KEY>.yaml`. No post-create rename. Vended README is rewritten away from template boilerplate.

Eval prompts (JSON):

- [`evals/extract-intent.json`](../../evals/extract-intent.json)
- [`evals/judge-naming.json`](../../evals/judge-naming.json)

Jira board I/O: **Atlassian** Automation tools only (`docs/automation-setup.md`).
